laration","name":"QOU.Fermion","kind":"structure","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L63-L68","doc":"**Fermion**: a q-harmonic form with non-trivial vertical component.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:fermion}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:fermion-boson-decomposition","label":"def:fermion-boson-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHarmonicForm.q_laplacian_vanishes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHarmonicForm.q_laplacian_vanishes","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The q-Laplacian vanishes: `Δ_q α = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHarmonicForm.q_laplacian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHarmonicForm.q_laplacian","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The q-Laplacian value `Δ_q(α)` at each point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHarmonicForm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHarmonicForm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHarmonicForm.toReebDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHarmonicForm.toReebDecomposition","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L57-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QHarmonicForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QHarmonicForm","kind":"structure","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L53-L61","doc":"**q-Harmonic form (Particle)**: a section in the kernel of `Δ_q`.\nRe-declared from `QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.Particles` (see the\nnote on `ReebDecomposition` above).  Keep field-for-field in sync.\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:q-harmonic-form}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-harmonic-form","label":"def:q-harmonic-form","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/q-harmonic-form.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.decomp","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Decomposition identity: `total = horizontal + vertical`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.vertical","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.vertical","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Vertical component `α_V = θ ∧ ι_ξ α`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.horizontal","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L47-L47","doc":"Horizontal component `α_H` satisfying `ι_ξ α_H = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.total","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L45-L45","doc":"The total form (abstract representative). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition.mk","kind":"ctor","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ReebDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ReebDecomposition","kind":"structure","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/fermion-boson-decomposition.lean#L33-L51","doc":"**Reeb decomposition** of a differential form on a CR manifold.\n\nRe-declared from the library module\n`QOU.QuantumObservableUniverse.Particles` so this sibling is a\nself-contained compilation unit — importing the library module would\ncollide with this block's own `Fermion` / `Boson` /\n`Boson.total_eq_horizontal` declarations.  Keep field-for-field in\nsync with the library.\n\nLaTeX: `\\label{def:reeb-decomposition}` ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:ex:reeb-decomposition","label":"ex:reeb-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/models-of-qous/reeb-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}